Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He, he popped them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How on earth did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are wires attached to\Nhis head he's manipulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He popped my bubbles with\Nthe wind that they created.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then that means they were\Ndesigned to be anti-Harmon weapons.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,Main,Speedwagon,0,0,0,,{\an8}These monsters already understand how Hamon works...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(363,860)}WAMUU
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,Main,Speedwagon,0,0,0,,{\an8}These monsters already understand how the Ripple works...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(363,860)}WHAM
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow they're already familiar\Nwith the principles of Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have faced Harmon at\Nsome point over 2,000 years ago!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.85,0:02:45.06,Main,Speedwagon,0,0,0,,{\an8}...just from when they encountered it two thousand years ago!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.81,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(1400,860)}ESIDISI
