Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These humans know Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we destroyed all the members\Nof the Hamon tribe 2,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, here they are, ready to\Nwelcome us at our own awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think losing an eye will stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Why are you laughing? What's so\Nfunny? You all have memorized your humble
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handbook very well you always say the same
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing it was that way when we crossed from
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the western continent and it is that way\Nnow still do you think losing an arm or
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an eye or a leg will stop me how dare you\Ntake my friend's life don't you know how
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much i loved him that's why we laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human you, you bastards!\NIgnore him. We're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a quest to find the stone what where
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you going face me cowards you're most
