Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vulnerable in your throat and your lungs\Nwe know that if you can't breathe then your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hormone is rendered useless but because\Ni cannot resist a worthy opponent hear me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i shall spare you because i\Nlong for the opportunity to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet you again when you are\Nstronger. The next time we meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i want to admire your strength\Ni want you to become worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my time so that i might\Ndestroy you with great honor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it appears that he was the only\Nhamon user let's move Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just can't seem\Nto shake this cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the hormone\Ntraining that's making me ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, he only sliced your eyelid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The actual eyeball itself is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've all seen enough of\Nthe bubble launcher for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn as I take\Ncare of this one myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to show off the brand\Nnew technique I've been working on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these are the hands known for\Ndefeating your mate-son Viento.
