Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo, what the hell do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to disrespect\Nmy friend by playing the fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not intentionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, I am truly sorry\Nfor the loss of your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand both your\Npain and your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Additionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these guys may be the biggest group of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,egotistical jackasses\NI've ever seen in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not be a master of this yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll still knock you into next\NTuesday with my clacker volley.
