Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but I know\Nthat my harmon is relatively weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I can make up for what\NI'm lacking with these steel clackers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I can just break open your skin\Neven a little and fill you with harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should even up my\Nhandicap, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you're nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the human race has\Nregressed rather than evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amusing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your childish little games are\Ngoing to get us all killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's playing coy, but this may\Nactually be the best Jojo's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be fine if he was facing\Nsome common street punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't think he realizes that these
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,opponents are on a\Ncompletely different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be comical if\Nit weren't so tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't anyone taking my\Nlittle metal balls seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me clack you into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel that human\Nlives are short enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to sprint to your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've ever had spaghetti on Nero\Nde Cepia, you know it looks bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should taste my clacker\Nvolley before you judge it!
