Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clackers, they vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:08:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been training on my\Nharmon, all the live-long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at Mar, no hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the clackers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true magician never reveals his secrets.
