Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can anything move like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's faster than Santana, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think those idiotic\Nclackers did so much as graze him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire your weapon, your courage,\Nand your creativity, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually enjoying your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is how much time I will allow\Nyou to fight the mighty Wamuu.
