Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall use your wound as a timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:09:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wrist will work well\Nas a timekeeping device,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.46,0:09:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you will lose consciousness due to\Na loss of blood in exactly one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what you can do, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I often told the\Nmembers of the Hamon tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is now my\Nhourglass, measured in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu, we'll be waiting outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, boy, go ahead and retrieve\Nyour weapon, quickly. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm growing deaf in this ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It almost sounded like you said\Ngo ahead and retrieve your weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which would be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why would you retrieve\Nsomething that comes right back to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.56,0:09:38.60,SFXRed3,13,0,0,0,,{=55}{\blur0.6\frz11.73\pos(1873.98,784.24)\3c&H606081&\c&H606081&}Boom {In preview for last episode}
