Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my clack of\Nboomerang worked pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't even need the full\Nminute to destroy you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for killing Caesar's friend.\NThat's for not taking me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's because I'm sick\Nof looking at your ugly face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I deserve as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No opponent has ever struck my face, and\Nthis is the price for my carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall take this beating in order to\Nproperly honor you before I destroy you.
