Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even stop to blink when you\Nkilled Caesar's friend Mark, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not value life at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arm isn't broken, he's\Ngetting ready to use it!
