Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I have a feeling\Nthis isn't good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A charming observation, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm now scarred due to my carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my duty to allow you to pummel me\Nas punishment for my own lack of judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has now ended, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo, finish him now while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ultimate technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Divine Sandstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He starts by spinning\Nhis left arm clockwise
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then his right arm counterclockwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo is unprepared to\Ncounter a technique like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this as Wamuu's fists seem\Nto grow before his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air between Wamuu's arms transforms\Ninto a powerful vortex of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This vacuum creates a highly\Npressurized, deadly maelstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, if he can tear\Nthrough marble pillars,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see myself having much of a\Nchance against a windstorm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever\Nseen anything this powerful!
