Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call that divine sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try and distract him somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse this blood in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Threw off my aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it proved enough when you made\Nthe choice to hide behind a pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You died quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, I would ignore human\Nonlookers such as yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you witnessed my shame, so unfortunately\NI must take the time to destroy you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may pray now if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That coward has no shame\Nplaying dead like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand leaving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was spineless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is the most\Npowerful foe I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breathing is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control my Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really have any other option left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, my specialty is running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold our now broken hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo forced to play dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crawling for his life, and now leaving\NSpeedwagon behind to face certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with all of this, Jojo remains\Ndedicated, a hero worthy of this tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try there, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No true warrior would ever feign\Ndeath just to save himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:14:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be true, though my intention\Nwas not to escape, but to distract.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I was just trying\Nto get you onto this minecart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are clever indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you were only playing the part of the\Ncoward to lure me away from your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That trick is probably older than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out now, Speedwagon. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chocho.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a noble move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've painted\Nmyself into a corner here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to come up with a second\Npart to my plan, which would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The unflappable hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He calmly searches for options,\Nnot knowing what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his will remains unbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in far worse shape than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been the\None to lure Wamuu away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now that Jojo only acts\Nfoolishly to confound his opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:15:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must actually have a good\Nplan to beat those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you are quite confident for\Nsomeone who is knocking on death's door,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must tell you that\Nyour plan is a poor one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite tough, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.74,0:15:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soft-headed, but tough nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how do you remain unyielding\Nin the moments before your death?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because you have bricks for brains,\Nor do you still have another trick for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to know?\NActually, no. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're so obviously clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the benefit of\Nthe doubt that you wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid enough to be holding a\Nstick of dynamite behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know you wouldn't insult my\Nintelligence by thinking you could
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quickly throw the brake and send\Nthe mine cart flying off the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he got me there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time on your hourglass\Nwrist is just about up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is absolutely no chance that\Nyou will survive this any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found your tricks to be very quaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you die, tell me, why do I\Nstill not see defeat in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you if you want, but you're\Ngonna have to say please first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More games!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.57,0:16:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've tested me long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die! Such a shame,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because a month from now I can guarantee\Nthat I would be able to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With just one more month of\Ntraining, I would annihilate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the first person to hit as\Nwell as the first to scar your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I put my mind to something, I\Ncan accomplish pretty much anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I guess none of\Nthat really matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, can we just get this over with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be an honor to be killed by\Na warrior like you, blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick and tired\Nof all this talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and make it\Npainless, Wamu. Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to get at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you pillar\Nmen often live for millennia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a long time to be\Nwalking around with the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shame of having your face\Nrearranged by a lowly human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that the only way\Nyou could regain your honor would be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by defeating me in a fight after I've\Nundergone proper Harmon training.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not have to defeat you\Nin order to maintain my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His entire body is shaking with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a chance if I can make him\Nthink his integrity is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave himself away as the proud warrior\Ntype the moment he called me a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pride is his Achilles' heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you noticed,\Nbut I'm still new at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I trained with my Harmon for a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I could give you the fair\Nfight a warrior like you deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first person who ever hit you\Nin the face gave you a nasty scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be a shame if you killed\Nthat person before he's worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you feel the need to kill me before
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a chance to battle you as an equal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then go ahead and do\Nwhatever you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master AC/DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave this human one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must you insist on\Nletting him toy with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost had him!
