Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master ACDC, I have grown fond of this\Nparticular member of the Hamon tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you will be happy to know that I\Nhave decided to accept your proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you swear that you will train your\Nhardest to fulfill your potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I will give you\Nexactly one month to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're not going to kill me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.48,0:19:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're going to fight again. We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance to take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I will need assurances that you\Nwill not try to run away again, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, Wham.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering when you\Nwould finally propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the wedding ring of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess where it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hint, not on your finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that?
