Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ring will start\Nto dissolve in 33 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to remove.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once dissolved, it will\Nrelease a virulent poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any attempt to remove or damage it\Nwill also release the lethal poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, there is one certain way\Nto dissolve the ring without harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply battle and defeat\Nme within 33 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I shall give you the antidote that\NI keep inside the hollow of my lip ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:20:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vow on that wedding ring\Nstates, till death do us part, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be at the Coliseum in 33 days,\Nmeet me there at midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we shall battle as equals, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you didn't think your poultry\Ntricks would help you escape, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't imagine the two of us will fight,\Nbut just in case, here's a gift for you.
