Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart and my throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poison is quite different from Wammu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I keep the antidote for\Nthat poison in my nose ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars, would you like to go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Immortality can be boring at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To encounter a worthy opponent, that is\Nboth such a rare and tantalizing thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gift that would give our lives meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see why you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, do not forget that our goal\Nis to obtain the Red Stone of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Train long and hard, Jojo, so you\Ncan challenge my divine sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two wedding rings with poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be some\Nkind of sick joke or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got one around my throat\Nand one around my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do these guys think I'm some\Nkind of bigamist or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least Speedwagon\Nand Caesar are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sense in feeling sorry for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was one hell of a\Nbluff you just pulled there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best con man couldn't\Nhave done it better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You acted bravely, but now\Nyou'll need to back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time to work, and\Nwe have serious Haman training ahead.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.96,0:21:59.84,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:22:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake,\Nmountains come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.84,0:22:02.18,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.18,0:22:06.39,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They stand there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,24 before my love, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.39,0:22:13.10,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love and I'll be there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.47,0:23:28.47,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\pos(960,700)\bord5.5\blur2}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I said I needed a month,\NI only meant it as a blurb!
